App Server 1
Stage

The task requires exactly one stage:

stage('Deploy')

Notice the capital D.

It must be:

Deploy

not:

deploy

or:

Deployment
20. Master deployment

When you run:

BRANCH=master

Jenkins executes:

cd /var/www/html
git fetch origin
git checkout master
git reset --hard origin/master

So the current document root becomes the latest master branch.

21. Feature deployment

When:

BRANCH=feature

is supplied, Jenkins executes:

cd /var/www/html
git fetch origin
git checkout feature
git reset --hard origin/feature

Therefore:

/var/www/html

contains the feature branch.

22. Why we're not doing git clone

Do not do:

git clone ... /var/www/html/web_app

because that would produce:

/var/www/html/web_app

The website would then potentially be available at:

https://<LBR-URL>/web_app

The task specifically says this is wrong.

We want:

/var/www/html/index.html

rather than:

/var/www/html/web_app/index.html

Therefore the existing repository in /var/www/html is used directly.

