33. One important issue to watch for

Because /var/www/html is already a Git repository, don't use git pull blindly if the lab has potentially modified files.

This:

git fetch origin
git checkout master
git reset --hard origin/master

is more deterministic for a lab deployment.

It means:

Make /var/www/html exactly match the selected remote branch.

For a real production system, we'd normally be more careful about uncommitted changes, deployment artifacts, ownership, and rollback. For this KodeKloud-style task, the above is a clean approach.

